{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1538965-your-boss-is-going-crazy-and-you-think-you-like-it","id":1538965,"title":"Your boss is going crazy, and you think you like it","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-21T08:25:07-07:00","id":1538965,"title":"Your boss is going crazy, and you think you like it","content":"You're a live-in housekeeper. Lately, your employer's schedule has gotten stranger. He comes home all roughed up, with a thousand-yard stare. You're pretty sure his instructions on how to answer the house phone are lies. You wonder if you might be an accessory to a crime.<br /> On the other hand...<br /> He always gets your name right, now. Sometimes he asks after your family. Before, you weren't sure he realized you <i>had</i> a family.<br /> <i>(A brush with death can do that. He's been thinking a lot about all the things he might lose, things he used to take for granted.)</i><br /> He's gotten a lot nicer.<br /> <i>(Fighting on the front line of a secret war means that he doesn't have to put the help down to make himself feel big - he feels big enough already now.)</i><br /> He's <i>interesting </i>and <i>complicated </i>now. If he tries to get you into bed, you'll do it. You're waiting for the day. Once you almost thought it was going to happen when you were helping him change a bandage on one of the hard-to-reach places.<br /> <br /> Congratulations! You are now an Ashwood Abbey hunter's Touchstone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28549,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","user":"Sikander","date":".  Grammar and style 07-21-2024, 08:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28549-sikander","name":"Sikander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-na